Investigated this on **Claude.app v1.2581.0** (macOS, Apple Silicon). The fix is 2 lines of CSS in a single existing injection point — no architectural changes needed.

## Root cause

Claude.app loads `claude.ai` in `WebContentsView` instances. Each view already receives post-load CSS injection in `.vite/build/index.js`:

```js
e.on("did-finish-load", () => {
  e.insertCSS("* { -webkit-app-region: no-drag !important; app-region: no-drag !important; }")
});
```

That exact string appears **3 time
